    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trail of the Cryptid is a\u00a0chilling psychological horror adventure where the line between hunter and hunted blurs. Search for cryptids in the dark wilderness, and uncover clues to find their lair. Gather enough evidence to prove their existence, or kill the creature to return its carcass. Use stealth to avoid detection or use direct combat with guns, explosives, and traps.<br><br> Initially you'll be hunting bigfoot, but other cryptids will be added in future updates. Each cryptid will have unique abilities and strategies.<br><br>Investigate locations where the creature has been sighted, and search for evidence, like footprints and fur. Take photos of the beast. Gather enough evidence to win the game, but the best evidence will require getting close to the creature in its lair.<br><br>Play with up to three of your friends.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trail of the Cryptid is a\u00a0chilling psychological horror adventure where the line between hunter and hunted blurs. Search for cryptids in the dark wilderness, and uncover clues to find their lair. Gather enough evidence to prove their existence, or kill the creature to return its carcass. Use stealth to avoid detection or use direct combat with guns, explosives, and traps.<br><br> Initially you'll be hunting bigfoot, but other cryptids will be added in future updates. Each cryptid will have unique abilities and strategies.<br><br>Investigate locations where the creature has been sighted, and search for evidence, like footprints and fur. Take photos of the beast. Gather enough evidence to win the game, but the best evidence will require getting close to the creature in its lair.<br><br>Play with up to three of your friends.</p>",
    "short_description": "Uncover the mysteries lurking in the wilderness. Team up with friends to find a creature that is stalking people. Gather evidence using stealth or confront the creature head-on in this thrilling co-op survival adventure.",
